<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11282" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">correptĭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conr-</span></b> ),
		ōnis, f.
		id. (not ante-Aug., and rare). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A laying hold of, seizing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 20, 10, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(morbi),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 171</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>reproof,
			reproach</i>, <i><span class="en">Tert. Pudic.
			14</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A shortening, decreasing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dierum (opp. crescentia),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 9,
					9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syllabae (opp. productio),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 7, 9, 13</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vocum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					9, 3, 69</span></i>
			.</div>
